Photo and video detection on Linux, in a virtual machine on the development Mac (Apple Virtualization, 8 of its 12 cores).
Sample: 738 photos from the second blind photo batch (407 AI, 331 real; JPEG, PNG, WebP, GIF).

### system
Linux 7.0.0-38-generic aarch64
Ubuntu 26.04.1 LTS
8 virtual CPUs, 11 GB
rustc 1.99.1 (58cf8f9c3 2026-10-13)
